% expect-output: Helvetica-Bold
% expect-output: Times-Roman
% expect-output: Courier-BoldOblique
% expect-output: Times-Italic
% Scenario: metric-pair aliases. Names of the metrically compatible
% families, with their PostScript-name suffixes and style parts, resolve
% to the standard font of the same class and style; ZapfChancery maps to
% Times-Italic. Expected divergence: the reference raises invalidfont.
% Expect: the four substitute names.
/Arial-BoldMT findfont /FontName get =
/TimesNewRomanPSMT findfont /FontName get =
/CourierNewPS-BoldItalicMT findfont /FontName get =
/ZapfChancery-MediumItalic findfont /FontName get =
